        "arguments": {
          "html": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\">\n<head>\n    <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n    <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n    <title>电磁感应可视化模拟器</title>\n    <style>\n        * {\n            margin: 0;\n            padding: 0;\n            box-sizing: border-box;\n        }\n        body {\n            font-family: 'Segoe UI', Tahoma, Geneva, Verdana, sans-serif;\n            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #1a1a2e 0%, #16213e 50%, #0f3460 100%);\n            min-height: 100vh;\n            display: flex;\n            flex-direction: column;\n            align-items: center;\n            padding: 20px;\n            color: #fff;\n        }\n        h1 {\n            text-align: center;\n            margin-bottom: 10px;\n            color: #00d9ff;\n            text-shadow: 0 0 20px rgba(0,217,255,0.5);\n            font-size: 1.8em;\n        }\n        .subtitle {\n            text-align: center;\n            color: #888;\n            margin-bottom: 20px;\n            font-size: 0.9em;\n        }\n        .container {\n            display: flex;\n            flex-wrap: wrap;\n            gap: 20px;\n            justify-content: center;\n            max-width: 1200px;\n            width: 100%;\n        }\n        .simulation-area {\n            background: rgba(255,255,255,0.05);\n            border-radius: 20px;\n            padding: 20px;\n            border: 2px solid rgba(0,217,255,0.3);\n            box-shadow: 0 0 30px rgba(0,217,255,0.1);\n        }\n        .canvas-container {\n            position: relative;\n            margin: 0 auto;\n        }\n        canvas {\n            border-radius: 15px;\n            background: #0a0a15;\n            cursor: pointer;\n        }\n        .data-panel {\n            background: rgba(255,255,255,0.08);\n            border-radius: 15px;\n            padding: 20px;\n            min-width: 280px;\n            border: 2px solid rgba(255,200,0,0.3);\n        }\n        .data-title {\n            color: #ffc800;\n            font-size: 1.2em;\n            margin-bottom: 15px;\n            text-align: center;\n            border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,200,0,0.3);\n            padding-bottom: 10px;\n        }\n        .data-item {\n            display: flex;\n            justify-content: space-between;\n            padding: 10px 0;\n            border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.1);\n        }\n        .data-label {\n            color: #aaa;\n        }\n        .data-value {\n            color: #00ff88;\n            font-weight: bold;\n            font-size: 1.1em;\n        }\n        .controls {\n            background: rgba(255,255,255,0.08);\n            border-radius: 15px;\n            padding: 20px;\n            margin-top: 20px;\n            border: 2px solid rgba(150,100,255,0.3);\n        }\n        .control-title {\n            color: #c084fc;\n            font-size: 1.1em;\n            margin-bottom: 15px;\n            text-align: center;\n        }\n        .slider-group {\n            margin: 15px 0;\n        }\n        .slider-label {\n            display: flex;\n            justify-content: space-between;\n            margin-bottom: 8px;\n            color: #ccc;\n        }\n        input[type=\"range\"] {\n            width: 100%;\n            height: 8px;\n            border-radius: 4px;\n            background: rgba(255,255,255,0.2);\n            outline: none;\n            -webkit-appearance: none;\n        }\n        input[type=\"range\"]::-webkit-slider-thumb {\n            -webkit-appearance: none;\n            width: 20px;\n            height: 20px;\n            border-radius: 50%;\n            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #00d9ff, #00ff88);\n            cursor: pointer;\n            box-shadow: 0 0 10px rgba(0,217,255,0.5);\n        }\n        .direction-toggle {\n            display: flex;\n            justify-content: center;\n            gap: 15px;\n            margin-top: 15px;\n        }\n        .direction-btn {\n            padding: 10px 25px;\n            border: none;\n            border-radius: 25px;\n            cursor: pointer;\n            font-size: 1em;\n            transition: all 0.3s;\n        }\n        .direction-btn.left {\n            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #ff6b6b, #ee5a5a);\n            color: white;\n        }\n        .direction-btn.right {\n            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #4ecdc4, #44a08d);\n            color: white;\n        }\n        .direction-btn.active {\n            transform: scale(1.1);\n            box-shadow: 0 0 20px rgba(255,255,255,0.3);\n        }\n        .explanation {\n            background: rgba(255,255,255,0.05);\n            border-radius: 15px;\n            padding: 20px;\n            margin-top: 20px;\n            max-width: 800px;\n            border-left: 4px solid #00d9ff;\n        }\n        .explanation h3 {\n            color: #00d9ff;\n            margin-bottom: 10px;\n        }\n        .explanation p {\n            color: #ccc;\n            line-height: 1.8;\n        }\n        .formula {\n            background: rgba(0,217,255,0.1);\n            padding: 10px 15px;\n            border-radius: 8px;\n            margin: 10px 0;\n            font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\n            font-size: 1.3em;\n            color: #00ff88;\n            text-align: center;\n        }\n        .legend {\n            display: flex;\n            justify-content: center;\n            gap: 20px;\n            margin-top: 15px;\n            flex-wrap: wrap;\n        }\n        .legend-item {\n            display: flex;\n            align-items: center;\n            gap: 8px;\n            font-size: 0.9em;\n            color: #aaa;\n        }\n        .legend-color {\n            width: 20px;\n            height: 20px;\n            border-radius: 4px;\n        }\n        .play-btn {\n            display: block;\n            margin: 15px auto 0;\n            padding: 12px 40px;\n            border: none;\n            border-radius: 30px;\n            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #667eea, #764ba2);\n            color: white;\n            font-size: 1.1em;\n            cursor: pointer;\n            transition: all 0.3s;\n        }\n        .play-btn:hover {\n            transform: translateY(-2px);\n            box-shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(102,126,234,0.4);\n        }\n        .play-btn.active {\n            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #f093fb, #f5576c);\n        }\n    </style>\n</head>\n<body>\n    <h1>⚡ 电磁感应可视化模拟器</h1>\n    <p class=\"subtitle\">法拉第的发现 - 运动的磁场产生电流</p>\n    \n    <div class=\"container\">\n        <div class=\"simulation-area\">\n            <div class=\"canvas-container\">\n                <canvas id=\"simCanvas\" width=\"500\" height=\"400\"></canvas>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"legend\">\n                <div class=\"legend-item\">\n                    <div class=\"legend-color\" style=\"background: #4a90d9;\"></div>\n                    <span>磁场 (垂直纸面向外)</span>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"legend-item\">\n                    <div class=\"legend-color\" style=\"background: #ff6b6b;\"></div>\n                    <span>导体棒</span>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"legend-item\">\n                    <div class=\"legend-color\" style=\"background: #ffd93d;\"></div>\n                    <span>感应电流</span>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"legend-item\">\n                    <div class=\"legend-color\" style=\"background: #6bcb77;\"></div>\n                    <span>电流方向 (A→B)</span>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n        \n        <div class=\"data-panel\">\n            <div class=\"data-title\">📊 实时数据</div>\n            <div class=\"data-item\">\n                <span class=\"data-label\">磁感应强度 B</span>\n                <span class=\"data-value\" id=\"BValue\">1.0 T</span>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"data-item\">\n                <span class=\"data-label\">导体长度 L</span>\n                <span class=\"data-value\">0.4 m</span>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"data-item\">\n                <span class=\"data-label\">运动速度 v</span>\n                <span class=\"data-value\" id=\"vValue\">2.0 m/s</span>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"data-item\">\n                <span class=\"data-label\">感应电动势 ε</span>\n                <span class=\"data-value\" id=\"emfValue\">0.80 V</span>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"data-item\">\n                <span class=\"data-label\">感应电流方向</span>\n                <span class=\"data-value\" id=\"currentDir\">A → B</span>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"data-item\">\n                <span class=\"data-label\">电路状态</span>\n                <span class=\"data-value\" id=\"circuitStatus\">闭合 ✓</span>\n            </div>\n            \n            <div class=\"controls\">\n                <div class=\"control-title\">🎛️ 参数控制</div>\n                <div class=\"slider-group\">\n                    <div class=\"slider-label\">\n                        <span>磁场强度 B</span>\n                        <span id=\"bSliderVal\">1.0 T</span>\n                    </div>\n                    <input type=\"range\" id=\"bSlider\" min=\"0.5\" max=\"2\" step=\"0.1\" value=\"1\">\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"slider-group\">\n                    <div class=\"slider-label\">\n                        <span>运动速度 v</span>\n                        <span id=\"vSliderVal\">2.0 m/s</span>\n                    </div>\n                    <input type=\"range\" id=\"vSlider\" min=\"0.5\" max=\"5\" step=\"0.1\" value=\"2\">\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"direction-toggle\">\n                    <button class=\"direction-btn left\" id=\"leftBtn\" onclick=\"setDirection('left')\">← 向左移动</button>\n                    <button class=\"direction-btn right active\" id=\"rightBtn\" onclick=\"setDirection('right')\">向右移动 →</button>\n                </div>\n                <button class=\"play-btn\" id=\"playBtn\" onclick=\"toggleAnimation()\">▶️ 播放动画</button>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n    \n    <div class=\"explanation\">\n        <h3>💡 原理解析</h3>\n        <p>当导体棒在磁场中<strong>切割磁感线运动</strong>时，导体中的自由电子受到洛伦兹力作用会发生定向移动，从而产生感应电动势和感应电流。</p>\n        <div class=\"formula\">ε = B × L × v × sinθ</div>\n        <p>在这个实验中，导体运动方向与磁感线<strong>垂直</strong>（θ=90°），所以 sinθ=1。</p>\n        <p id=\"directionExplain\">📍 使用<strong>右手定则</strong>：伸出右手，让磁感线穿入手心（垂直纸面向外），大拇指指向导体运动方向，则四指所指即为感应电流方向（A→B）。</p>\n    </div>\n\n    <script>\n        const canvas = document.getElementById('simCanvas');\n        const ctx = canvas.getContext('2d');\n        \n        // 参数\n        let B = 1.0;\n        let v = 2.0;\n        let L = 0.4;\n        let direction = 'right';\n        let animating = false;\n        let barX = 50;\n        let animationId = null;\n        \n        // 磁感线点\n        let fieldDots = [];\n        function initFieldDots() {\n            fieldDots = [];\n            for (let x = 80; x < 450; x += 25) {\n                for (let y = 50; y < 350; y += 25) {\n                    fieldDots.push({x, y, phase: Math.random() * Math.PI * 2});\n                }\n            }\n        }\n        initFieldDots();\n        \n        // 绘制磁场符号（⊙ 表示向里）\n        function drawMagneticField() {\n            ctx.fillStyle = '#4a90d9';\n            ctx.font = 'bold 16px Arial';\n            for (let x = 100; x < 450; x += 60) {\n                for (let y = 100; y < 350; y += 60) {\n                    ctx.fillText('⊙', x - 6, y + 6);\n                }\n            }\n            \n            // 标签\n            ctx.fillStyle = '#4a90d9';\n            ctx.font = '14px Arial';\n            ctx.fillText('B (垂直纸面向外)', 320, 380);\n        }\n        \n        // 绘制导体框（包含导轨）\n        function drawCircuit() {\n            // 导轨（两条平行线）\n            ctx.strokeStyle = '#666';\n            ctx.lineWidth = 4;\n            ctx.beginPath();\n            ctx.moveTo(40, 200);\n            ctx.lineTo(460, 200);\n            ctx.moveTo(40, 280);\n            ctx.lineTo(460, 280);\n            ctx.stroke();\n            \n            // 电阻（矩形表示）\n            ctx.fillStyle = '#ff6b6b';\n            ctx.fillRect(420, 230, 30, 50);\n            ctx.fillStyle = '#333';\n            ctx.font = '12px Arial';\n            ctx.fillText('R', 430, 260);\n            \n            // 连接线\n            ctx.strokeStyle = '#ffd93d';\n            ctx.lineWidth = 3;\n            ctx.beginPath();\n            ctx.moveTo(450, 200);\n            ctx.lineTo(450, 180);\n            ctx.lineTo(200, 180);\n            ctx.lineTo(200, 100);\n            ctx.moveTo(450, 280);\n            ctx.lineTo(450, 300);\n            ctx.lineTo(200, 300);\n            ctx.lineTo(200, 100);\n            ctx.stroke();\n            \n            // A点标记\n            ctx.fillStyle = '#6bcb77';\n            ctx.font = 'bold 16px Arial';\n            ctx.fillText('A', 195, 95);\n            \n            // B点标记\n            ctx.fillStyle = '#ff6b6b';\n            ctx.fillText('B', 195, 305);\n        }\n        \n        // 绘制导体棒\n        function drawBar() {\n            const y1 = 200;\n            const y2 = 280;\n            \n            // 导体棒主体\n            const gradient = ctx.createLinearGradient(barX, 0, barX + 30, 0);\n            gradient.addColorStop(0, '#ff6b6b');\n            gradient.addColorStop(1, '#ee5a5a');\n            ctx.fillStyle = gradient;\n            ctx.fillRect(barX, y1, 30, y2 - y1);\n            \n            // 边框\n            ctx.strokeStyle = '#fff';\n            ctx.lineWidth = 2;\n            ctx.strokeRect(barX, y1, 30, y2 - y1);\n            \n            // 电流方向指示\n            if (animating) {\n                const arrowDir = direction === 'right' ? 1 : -1;\n                const arrowX = barX + 15;\n                const arrowY = (y1 + y2) / 2;\n                \n                // 电流符号（交替显示）\n                const t = Date.now() / 200;\n                for (let i = 0; i < 3; i++) {\n                    const offset = ((t + i * 1.5) % 4.5 - 2.25) * 30;\n                    const ax = arrowX + offset * arrowDir;\n                    if (ax > barX && ax < barX + 30) {\n                        ctx.fillStyle = '#ffd93d';\n                        ctx.font = 'bold 20px Arial';\n                        ctx.fillText('→', ax - 6, arrowY + 6);\n                    }\n                }\n            }\n        }\n        \n        // 绘制磁通量变化区域\n        function drawFlux() {\n            const flux = B * L * (barX - 40);\n            ctx.fillStyle = 'rgba(0, 217, 255, 0.1)';\n            ctx.fillRect(40, 200, barX - 40, 80);\n            \n            ctx.fillStyle = '#00d9ff';\n            ctx.font = '12px Arial';\n            ctx.fillText(`Φ = B×S = ${flux.toFixed(2)} Wb`, 50, 195);\n        }\n        \n        // 主绘制函数\n        function draw() {\n            ctx.clearRect(0, 0, canvas.width, canvas.height);\n            \n            // 背景网格\n            ctx.strokeStyle = 'rgba(255,255,255,0.05)';\n            ctx.lineWidth = 1;\n            for (let i = 0; i < canvas.width; i += 25) {\n                ctx.beginPath();\n                ctx.moveTo(i, 0);\n                ctx.lineTo(i, canvas.height);\n                ctx.stroke();\n            }\n            for (let i = 0; i < canvas.height; i += 25) {\n                ctx.beginPath();\n                ctx.moveTo(0, i);\n                ctx.lineTo(canvas.width, i);\n                ctx.stroke();\n            }\n            \n            drawMagneticField();\n            drawFlux();\n            drawCircuit();\n            drawBar();\n            \n            // 动画：移动的磁感线效果\n            if (animating) {\n                ctx.strokeStyle = 'rgba(74, 144, 217, 0.3)';\n                ctx.lineWidth = 1;\n                const offset = (Date.now() / 50 * v) % 50;\n                for (let x = 50; x < 460; x += 50) {\n                    ctx.beginPath();\n                    ctx.arc(x + (direction === 'right' ? offset : -offset), 225, 3, 0, Math.PI * 2);\n                    ctx.stroke();\n                }\n            }\n        }\n        \n        // 动画循环\n        function animate() {\n            if (!animating) return;\n            \n            if (direction === 'right') {\n                barX += v * 0.5;\n                if (barX > 400) barX = 400;\n            } else {\n                barX -= v * 0.5;\n                if (barX < 40) barX = 40;\n            }\n            \n            updateData();\n            draw();\n            animationId = requestAnimationFrame(animate);\n        }\n        \n        // 更新数据显示\n        function updateData() {\n            const emf = B * L * v;\n            document.getElementById('BValue').textContent = B.toFixed(1) + ' T';\n            document.getElementById('vValue').textContent = v.toFixed(1) + ' m/s';\n            document.getElementById('emfValue').textContent = emf.toFixed(2) + ' V';\n            document.getElementById('currentDir').textContent = direction === 'right' ? 'A → B' : 'B → A';\n        }\n        \n        // 切换动画状态\n        function toggleAnimation() {\n            animating = !animating;\n            const btn = document.getElementById('playBtn');\n            if (animating) {\n                btn.textContent = '⏸️ 暂停';\n                btn.classList.add('active');\n                animate();\n            } else {\n                btn.textContent = '▶️ 播放动画';\n                btn.classList.remove('active');\n                if (animationId) cancelAnimationFrame(animationId);\n            }\n        }\n        \n        // 设置移动方向\n        function setDirection(dir) {\n            direction = dir;\n            document.getElementById('leftBtn').classList.toggle('active', dir === 'left');\n            document.getElementById('rightBtn').classList.toggle('active', dir === 'right');\n            \n            // 更新解释文字\n            const explain = document.getElementById('directionExplain');\n            if (dir === 'right') {\n                explain.innerHTML = '📍 使用<strong>右手定则</strong>：伸出右手，让磁感线穿入手心（垂直纸面向外），大拇指指向导体运动方向，则四指所指即为感应电流方向（A→B）。';\n            } else {\n                explain.innerHTML = '📍 使用<strong>右手定则</strong>：伸出右手，让磁感线穿入手心（垂直纸面向外），大拇指指向导体运动方向，则四指所指即为感应电流方向（B→A）。';\n            }\n            \n            updateData();\n            draw();\n        }\n        \n        // 滑块事件\n        document.getElementById('bSlider').addEventListener('input', function() {\n            B = parseFloat(this.value);\n            document.getElementById('bSliderVal').textContent = B.toFixed(1) + ' T';\n            updateData();\n            draw();\n        });\n        \n        document.getElementById('vSlider').addEventListener('input', function() {\n            v = parseFloat(this.value);\n            document.getElementById('vSliderVal').textContent = v.toFixed(1) + ' m/s';\n            updateData();\n            draw();\n        });\n        \n        // 初始绘制\n        draw();\n        updateData();\n    </script>\n</body>\n</html>",
          "css": "",
          "js": "",
          "description": "高中电磁感应可视化模拟器，展示导体棒切割磁感线产生感应电流的过程，包含实时数据面板和交互控制"
        }
